# Line endings a checkout keeps whatever the local git is configured to do. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which gives run.sh CRLF endings bash cannot parse ("set: pipefail: invalid option name");
# cmd.exe, for its part, wants CRLF in run.bat.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
